{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20914","headline":"勉爱行二首送小季之庐山 一 · 李贺","name":"勉爱行二首送小季之庐山 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛郊无俎豆，弊廐慙老马。\n小雁过鑪峰，影落楚水下。\n长船倚云泊，石镜秋凉夜。\n岂解有乡情，弄月聊呜哑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}